OL,3,GNEWSA'Not right' to rush SEND reforms,
OL,4,Asays PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has insisted he is
OL,7,F"personally very, very focused" on
OL,8,Freforming special educational needs
OL,9,F(SEND), describing it as "a broken
OL,10,Fsystem".
OL,12,FAndy Burnham said the issue needed to
OL,13,Fbe "worked through" during a visit to
OL,14,FDerby last week but added he "can't fix
OL,15,FSEND in three months", in reference to
OL,16,Fhis time in office.
OL,18,FDerbyshire has been monitored by the
OL,19,Fgovernment for its SEND performance
OL,20,Fsince a government regulator found
OL,21,F"widespread and systemic" failings in
OL,22,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
